DESCRIPTION:Join us for a rally to End ICE detention in Indiana. This even
 t is part of a statewide day of action. Gather at Carmel Clay Veterans Mem
 orial (400-498 American Way\, across from the Farmers' Market)
LOCATION:Carmel Clay Veterans Memorial (across from farmers' market)\, 400
  American Way N\, Carmel\, IN\, 46032
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/947680/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
