BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bring-Your-Own-Book Meetup!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T140000
UID:7c514d7a4552e9763fe332e7c97be4c1@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/high-angle-people-reading-together_20260427045924500012.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Don't want the stress of an assigned book you may not even lik
 e? This is the bookish event for you! At a Bring-Your-Own-Book event\, we 
 all get together to discuss books we've read or are currently reading that
  we can't wait to talk about. Any genre\, any length\, any date of publica
 tion - let's get together and gush about our best recent reads! Stick arou
 nd after the event to learn more about Indivisible Central Indiana and how
  to get involved. Let's get reading!
LOCATION:Union Campus\, 525 S Meridian St\, Indianapolis\, IN\, 46225
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/946006/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
