 ploads/event/Statewide%20End%20ICE%20campaign%20Wabash_2026050400220619277
 4.png
DESCRIPTION:WABASH COUNTY @ Highways 13 & 24 11:00-11:30am This event is o
 ne of many events participating in a statewide day of action to protest im
 migrant detention centers in Indiana. We'll be holding BIG signs along hig
 hway 24. You are welcome to join us but we need to explain parking and saf
 ety information\, so contact may16indiana@gmail.com. - Over 70% of ICE det
 ainees have never been convicted of a crime. - ICE detainees at Miami Corr
 ectional Facility report medical neglect. - Two ICE detainees have di
LOCATION:Intersection of Hwys 24 & 13 in Wabash County\, Wabash\, IN\, 469
 92
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/949539/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
